+    // G1.8b: honour the guest's queued invocations from a driver that is not run().
+    //
+    // EeDispatcherTransfer is "the EE equivalent of a longjmp to the dispatcher" and this class
+    // documents that it "must only be caught at EeScheduler::run()". A driver with its own loop --
+    // tools/harness/vulcan4_harness.cpp is exactly that -- catches the signal itself, and if it then
