+            // needing translation. It is not: it is an ordinary physical RDRAM address the console
+            // kernel loads a game at, inside the identity-mapped low window. The bias was
+            // self-consistent (loader and guest both shifted) so nothing crashed, but it relocated
+            // the guest's whole .data segment 16MB down and manufactured a decoy that three goals
+            // then chased. These assertions are what was missing to catch it.
